            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MANDA2BH"
            },
            "reviewBody": "nice light flavor compared to heavy oil taste from restaurants. did use more sesame oil. cooked rice in programmable rice cooker (to save time), cooked eggs in sesame oil, then cooked shrimp in the sesame oil, then mixed all together in the skillet with more sesame oil and soy sauce for color. Family liked. will make again.",
            "datePublished": "2010-12-27T15:59:35.840Z"
          },
          {
