              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lukesdad"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Here's a small tip, use leftover rice or make the rice the day before. The fridge dries out the rice, it will not get that mushy texture. Helps if the other, or most of the other ingredients are cooked seperate, then put it all together in a hot wok or pan.",
            "datePublished": "2018-08-09T17:24:15.570Z"
