              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Southern Cooking Queen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe was perfect and quick!! I used large shrimp and cut them. With the rice I had day old in the fridge - only used 1.5 cups. Loved using sesame oil for scrambling the eggs!! Gave extra flavor! I used peas and carrots frozen bag! Topped with a little less than a teaspoon of my favorite soy sauce!!!",
            "datePublished": "2023-04-03T13:07:46.315Z"
